%% Workflow / BPM lifecycle flow
%% Shows process definition to runtime completion with escalation and compensation paths.
flowchart LR
    Model[Model Process]
    Deploy[Deploy Version]
    Start[Start Instance]
    Route[Route Tasks and Decisions]
    Wait[Wait for Signals and Timers]
    Complete[Complete Workflow]
    Compensate[Compensation Path]

    Model --> Deploy --> Start --> Route --> Wait --> Complete
    Wait -->|Timeout or exception| Route
    Route -->|Failure requiring rollback| Compensate --> Complete